The schemas, breakdown text, platform notes, and scripts in this repository are original writing. You may use and modify them. The breakdowns describe public ads. They are not the ads.

This repository does not include third-party video, brand artwork, or font files. `library/assets/license-ledger.json` lists source links for stock that used to be vendored here. Mixkit and Coverr do not allow those files to be redistributed as a library. Fetch them from the source URL under that source's license if you need them.

Do not copy a brand's logos, characters, or exact lines out of a breakdown into a new ad.
